thermal: expose CPU and MSM GPU temperature aggregation in userspace.

Keep explicit CPU choices and vendor package/GPU temperatures. Where only
individual CPU/CPUSS or GPUSS measurements exist, report their maximum.
Keep GPU hotspot separate from GPU/DDR temperatures. Discover all matching
hwmon and thermal inputs, tolerate missing or faulty sensors, and reopen
inputs to recover from transient failures without retaining stale values.
No board names, TSENS channel numbers or thermal policy are encoded here.

